---
import AppShell from '../layouts/AppShell.astro';
---

<AppShell>
  <section class="kickoff-hero card">
    <div class="kickoff-hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Kick-off</span>
      <h2>Tu punto de partida comercial</h2>
      <p>Un recorrido sencillo para pasar de tu cuenta de Gmail a decisiones comerciales claras.</p>
      <div class="kickoff-context"><span class="kickoff-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Cuenta autorizada y datos protegidos</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="kickoff-connection-panel">
      <div class="kickoff-connection-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">Conexiones de IA</span><strong>Elige tu proveedor</strong></div>
        <a href="/settings/ai" aria-label="Configurar conexiones de IA">Configurar <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p>La organización puede trabajar con cualquiera de estas conexiones.</p>
      <div class="kickoff-providers" aria-label="Proveedores de IA disponibles para configurar">
        <span><i class="kickoff-provider-dot kickoff-provider-openai" aria-hidden="true"></i>OpenAI</span>
        <span><i class="kickoff-provider-dot kickoff-provider-claude" aria-hidden="true"></i>Anthropic Claude</span>
        <span><i class="kickoff-provider-dot kickoff-provider-deepseek" aria-hidden="true"></i>DeepSeek</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="kickoff-route card" aria-labelledby="kickoffRouteTitle">
    <div class="kickoff-section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Cómo funciona</span>
        <h2 id="kickoffRouteTitle">De Gmail a la siguiente acción</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Empieza por cualquier paso. La aplicación mantiene cada cuenta separada y te pide confirmar las acciones.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kickoff-steps">
      <a class="kickoff-step" href="/mailbox">
        <span class="kickoff-step-icon"><img src="/icons/home/bandeja.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-number">01</span>
        <strong>Revisa tu bandeja</strong>
        <span>Encuentra correos y conversaciones que necesitan contexto.</span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-link">Abrir bandeja <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="kickoff-step" href="/follow-ups">
        <span class="kickoff-step-icon"><img src="/icons/home/seguimientos.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-number">02</span>
        <strong>Detecta lo pendiente</strong>
        <span>Localiza mensajes sin respuesta y posibles seguimientos.</span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-link">Ver seguimientos <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="kickoff-step" href="/commitments">
        <span class="kickoff-step-icon"><img src="/icons/home/compromiso.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-number">03</span>
        <strong>Organiza el trabajo</strong>
        <span>Revisa fechas, promesas y tareas antes de convertirlas en trabajo.</span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-link">Ver compromisos <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="kickoff-step kickoff-step-ai" href="/consultar-ia">
        <span class="kickoff-step-icon"><img src="/icons/home/consultar-ai.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-number">04</span>
        <strong>Consulta a la IA</strong>
        <span>Analiza conversaciones y decide qué hacer con más contexto.</span>
        <span class="kickoff-step-link">Consultar ahora <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="kickoff-notes" aria-label="Principios del espacio comercial">
    <div class="kickoff-note card"><img src="/icons/home/usuarios.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><div><strong>Una cuenta, una sesión</strong><span>Solo trabajas con la cuenta de Gmail autorizada.</span></div></div>
    <div class="kickoff-note card"><img src="/icons/home/reportes.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><div><strong>Todo bajo revisión</strong><span>La IA propone; tú decides antes de actuar.</span></div></div>
    <div class="kickoff-note card"><img src="/icons/home/settings-ai.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><div><strong>Carga progresiva</strong><span>Los mensajes se consultan por páginas para mantener agilidad.</span></div></div>
  </section>

</AppShell>

<style is:global>
  .kickoff-hero { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; min-height: 210px; margin-top: 18px; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(115deg, var(--surface-ai) 0%, var(--panel) 72%); }
  .kickoff-hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 650px; }
  .kickoff-hero h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .kickoff-hero p { max-width: 620px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; }
  .kickoff-context { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--body-copy); font-size: 12px; }
  .kickoff-status-dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4FAF7B; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(79, 175, 123, .14); animation: kickoff-pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .kickoff-connection-panel { flex: 0 0 min(390px, 38%); padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .6); }
  .kickoff-connection-heading { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; }
  .kickoff-connection-heading > div { display: grid; gap: 3px; }
  .kickoff-connection-heading strong { font-size: 16px; }
  .kickoff-connection-heading a { flex: 0 0 auto; color: var(--orange-dark); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .kickoff-connection-heading a:hover, .kickoff-connection-heading a:focus-visible { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; }
  .kickoff-connection-panel > p { margin: 12px 0 14px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .kickoff-providers { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .kickoff-providers span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 7px 9px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--body-copy); background: var(--panel); font-size: 11px; }
  .kickoff-provider-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--muted); }
  .kickoff-provider-openai { background: #5B9B75; }
  .kickoff-provider-claude { background: #C67A31; }
  .kickoff-provider-deepseek { background: #6F66BF; }
  .kickoff-route { margin-top: 14px; }
  .kickoff-section-heading { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .kickoff-section-heading h2 { margin: 3px 0 0; }
  .kickoff-section-heading p { max-width: 390px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .kickoff-steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .kickoff-step { position: relative; display: grid; align-content: start; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; min-height: 260px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; color: inherit; background: var(--surface-ai); text-decoration: none; transition: transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease; }
  .kickoff-step:not(:last-child)::after { content: '→'; position: absolute; z-index: 2; top: 50%; right: -22px; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: var(--orange-dark); background: var(--panel); font-size: 18px; transform: translateY(-50%); }
  .kickoff-step:hover, .kickoff-step:focus-visible { border-color: var(--orange-light); box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(35, 31, 32, .1); outline: none; transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .kickoff-step-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-radius: 13px; background: var(--panel); }
  .kickoff-step-icon img { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  .kickoff-step-number { color: var(--orange-dark); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .kickoff-step strong { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.15; }
  .kickoff-step > span:not(.kickoff-step-icon):not(.kickoff-step-number):not(.kickoff-step-link) { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .kickoff-step-link { align-self: end; margin-top: auto; color: var(--orange-dark); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .kickoff-step-ai { background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--surface-ai), rgba(111, 84, 204, .08)); }
  .kickoff-step-ai .kickoff-step-icon { background: rgba(111, 84, 204, .12); }
  .kickoff-step-ai .kickoff-step-link { color: #6650B8; }
  .kickoff-notes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .kickoff-note { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; }
  .kickoff-note img { flex: 0 0 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  .kickoff-note div { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .kickoff-note strong { font-size: 13px; }
  .kickoff-note span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }
  @keyframes kickoff-pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: .65; transform: scale(.9); } 50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .kickoff-status-dot { animation: none; } .kickoff-step { transition: none; } }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .kickoff-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .kickoff-step:nth-child(2)::after { display: none; } .kickoff-step:nth-child(3)::after { content: '↓'; top: auto; right: auto; bottom: -18px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); } .kickoff-notes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .kickoff-hero { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; } .kickoff-connection-panel { width: 100%; flex-basis: auto; } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .kickoff-section-heading { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; } .kickoff-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .kickoff-step { min-height: 0; } .kickoff-step:not(:last-child)::after, .kickoff-step:nth-child(3)::after { content: '↓'; top: auto; right: auto; bottom: -18px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); } }

</style>
